<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Aristocrat sells machines to casino.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Aristocrat sells machines to casino.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaming machine maker Aristocrat Leisure Ltd said on Monday it had signed a contract to supply more than 830 machines to the Sydney Harbour Casino Ltd.</p>
<p>Aristocrat said in a statement the casino would have about 1,500 gaming machines when the permanent complex opens in December this year.</p>
<p>Aristocrat did not put a price on the Sydney Casino deal but said it would be the major supplier of gaming machines for the Darling Harbour casino.</p>
</text>
